    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n<style>\n  :root {\n    --bg: #1e1e2f;\n    --card: #2a2a40;\n    --accent: #f5c542;\n    --text: #e0e0f0;\n    --border: #4a4a6a;\n  }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body {\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: var(--text);\n    padding: 16px;\n  }\n  .card {\n    background: var(--card);\n    border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 24px;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 400px;\n    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0f0f1a;\n    image-rendering: pixelated;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .field {\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  label {\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  input, select, button {\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--text);\n    border: 3px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    outline: none;\n    transition: border-color 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n  }\n  input:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(245, 197, 66, 0.3);\n  }\n  button {\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    background: var(--accent);\n    color: var(--bg);\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n  button:hover {\n    background: #ffd966;\n    border-color: #ffd966;\n    transform: translate(-2px, -2px);\n    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #0f0f1a;\n  }\n  button:active {\n    transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n    box-shadow: none;\n  }\n  .result-box {\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    padding: 16px;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    border: 3px dashed var(--border);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    min-height: 60px;\n    word-break: break-all;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 360px) {\n    .card { padding: 16px; }\n    h1 { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"card\">\n  <h1>Pixel Calc</h1>\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"left\">Left Number</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" id=\"left\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. -5\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"right\">Right Number</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" id=\"right\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 3\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n    <select id=\"operation\">\n      <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n      <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n      <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n      <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n    </select>\n  </div>\n  <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n  <div class=\"result-box\" id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</div>\n</main>\n<script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n  const leftInput = document.getElementById('left');\n  const rightInput = document.getElementById('right');\n  const opSelect = document.getElementById('operation');\n  const calcBtn = document.getElementById('calculate');\n  const resultEl = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function calculate() {\n    const leftRaw = leftInput.value.trim();\n    const rightRaw = rightInput.value.trim();\n    const op = opSelect.value;\n\n    if (leftRaw === '' || rightRaw === '') {\n      resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const left = Number(leftRaw);\n    const right = Number(rightRaw);\n\n    if (!Number.isFinite(left) || !Number.isFinite(right)) {\n      resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    let result;\n    switch (op) {\n      case 'add':\n        result = left + right;\n        break;\n      case 'subtract':\n        result = left - right;\n        break;\n      case 'multiply':\n        result = left * right;\n        break;\n      case 'divide':\n        if (right === 0) {\n          resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n          return;\n        }\n        result = left / right;\n        break;\n      default:\n        resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n        return;\n    }\n\n    if (!Number.isFinite(result)) {\n      resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    resultEl.textContent = String(result);\n  }\n\n  calcBtn.addEventListener('click', calculate);\n\n  [leftInput, rightInput].forEach(function (input) {\n    input.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n      if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        calculate();\n      }\n    });\n  });\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nA retro pixel-style offline calculator that performs addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division on two numbers.\n\n## Features\n- Inputs: `left` and `right` (support negative numbers)\n- Operation selector: add, subtract, multiply, divide\n- Calculate button (`calculate`) and result output (`result`)\n- Output shows only the numeric result or `Error`\n- Rejects empty, non-finite, or division-by-zero inputs with exact text `Error`\n- Keyboard accessible (Tab navigation, Enter to calculate)\n- Responsive from 360px wide\n\n## Usage\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a number in **Left Number** and **Right Number**.\n3. Choose an operation from the dropdown.\n4. Click **Calculate** or press Enter.\n5. The result appears in the output box below.\n\n## Files\n- `index.html` – structure and styling\n- `script.js` – calculator logic\n- `README.md` – this file\n\n## Constraints\n- No external packages, network requests, or storage.\n- Pure HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\n- Under 200 lines total.\n",
      "description": ""
    }
